{
  "name": "ondra-filter-chain",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的输出过滤九步链（手册 §4.1，P0）：草稿腔 → AI 自我暴露 → 硬红线 → 关系越线 → 阶段越线 → 旁白叙述 → 4-gram 复读 → 客服腔 → 长度兜底，逐条剥离、只在句边界动手。另带锚点检测（§4.6）与事后评审回环（§1.7：独立模型 1–100 分，低于阈值带反馈 steer，每轮最多 2 轮）。不生成正文、不改语气、不做需要第二个模型的语义判定。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
